      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING KRAVITZ (1) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in eight starts, including seven wins. Was out of the placings last time (30.41) at Q Parklands in a OPEN, finishing seventh and beaten 7 lengths. Has the ability and should feature. ARMARTA (6) has a strong record this trip with 18 wins and eight placings from 30 starts. Hit the frame latest (25.81) when second at Q Lakeside in a Grade 4/5. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. SPECIAL ROCKY (3) has a strong record this trip with 15 wins and two placings from 21 starts. Recorded a nose win (19.07) in a OPEN last time at Q Straight. Can feature with the right run. HARA'S JACKSON (7) is worth consideration after filling a hole at this course and distance last start.",
